{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-05_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-05","title":"落下物","storyCode":"2-5","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"a52fa327d711adc27b1cef026a10db9fb58866a21e4806914c0a4758fa656ad4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十七关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ、急いで！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい！　ミーシャさんも、行きましょう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……なんで……どうして、なの……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"こっちだ、早く来い！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"よし、近辺は問題なしね。追撃には注意して！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"さっきの人たちが、例の……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ええ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"先ほど少しお話しした、レユニオン・ムーブメントという組織……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そこに所属する、感染者たちです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"なんで……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして、感染者同士で争ったりなんて……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"スカルシュレッダー……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか、奴らを逃がしたのか……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"大したことじゃないさ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"どうせ逃げ切れやしないんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……それより……やっと、あいつを見つけることができた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"ずっと……この日が来るのを待ってたんだ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"到着だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"え？　本気で言ってるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"地図上の指定地点はここだからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"でも、これ……上へ行けってことじゃない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ、上とか言われたところで、意味はわかんないんだけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"――アーミヤ～！　こっちこっち！　上だよ、上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"え、エクシアさん……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"上、って……ビルの上へ登るルートなんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"うん、そーゆーこと！　ほらほら、あたしを信じてついてきて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"なんたってあたしは、龍門の道のことなら知りすぎなくらい知ってるんだから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あ、あはは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"階段はこっちだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"ねえ、これほんとに大丈夫なの？　包囲してくれって言ってるようなもんじゃない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"うだうだ言ってないで早く来なって！　グズグズしてると、レユニオンに見つかって、マジで包囲されちゃうよ～？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"うだうだって、あのねえ……！　はあ、もういいわ。あなたたち、先に行っててくれる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"あたしは入り口を溶接してくるから。そうすれば、少しは時間が稼げるでしょ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……階段の壁に、ペンギン急便のマークがついてるみたいですが……ここでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"そうそう、それそれ～！　その先を左に曲がったら、階段を上がっておいで！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ええと、一応お聞きしたいんですが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"地下通路があって、そこから脱出する……とかではなく、上へ上がる……で、合ってますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"もー、何度もそう言ってるじゃ～ん！　ほんとのほんとに上で合ってるんだって！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"でも、どうして上なんでしょう？　逃げ場がない気がするんですが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"本当に、エクシアさんを信じて大丈夫でしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"目的地に着きさえするのなら、どんな道でも通ってみせる。……それが、我々ペンギン急便のやり方なんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ、ひとまず一度試してみてくれ。きっと気に入ってもらえるはずだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……はぁ、はあ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ごめんなさい、ミーシャさん……まさかこんなことになるなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"ふぅ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"ところで、お前。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}だろう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……見たところ、階段を登るのは苦手らしいな。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["ミーシャ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["テキサス"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["エクシア"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["リスカム"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["スカルシュレッダー"]}]}
